[?2004l[?2004h>                     "supporting_quote": get_exact_quote(18, "The most common adverse reactions (≥1% incidence in the PAXLOVID group and occurring at a greater frequency than in the placebo group) were dysgeusia (5% and <1%, respectively) and diarrhea (3% and 2%, respectively).")
[?2004l[?2004h>                 },
